They are adapted from:

- 표준국어대사전 (Standard Korean Language Dictionary), 국립국어원 (National Institute of Korean Language)
  https://stdict.korean.go.kr/
  License: CC BY-SA 2.0 KR
  Changes: extracted noun headwords, removed markup and homonym numbers, filtered entries.

- 한국어 위키백과 (Korean Wikipedia) database dump, Wikipedia contributors
  https://dumps.wikimedia.org/kowiki/
  License: CC BY-SA 4.0
  Changes: counted noun occurrences with the Kiwi morphological analyzer.

